        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras/11530cd4e8aa29d01fc7fed419b7fd4b.avif?t=1763479003\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras/31a77c8581c0c4809815c841bd36e3f2.avif?t=1763479003\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras_big/31a77c8581c0c4809815c841bd36e3f2.avif?t=1763479003 width=800 height=267 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕯️ <strong>Message from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tales of Ancients</i> is a passion-driven project created by a single developer.<br>Thanks to your feedback, support, and curiosity, this dark story will continue to grow <br>and eventually reach its <strong>final form.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version represents <strong>the first chapter of Alex’s journey.</strong><br>If you wish to see what lies beyond the darkness... we’ll reach there together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕯️ <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Documentary photographer <strong>Alex Carter</strong> follows the trail of his missing grandfather to the forgotten town of <strong>Lynxvale</strong>.<br>But this place holds more than the remains of the past  it echoes something that was never meant to be remembered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the town stands the <strong>Hollow Apartments</strong>, a silent graveyard of trapped memories.<br>Each apartment carries the shadow of a life once lived.<br>Each floor unveils a part of Alex he never knew existed.<br>And every whisper pulls him deeper into himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This journey is the first step toward truth...<br>or perhaps where the truth truly begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙️ <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> A descent into the fragile border between sanity and delusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 <strong>Exploration &amp; Survival:</strong> Every step echoes through the silence. Light can guide you... or betray you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ <strong>Environmental Puzzles:</strong> Mechanical systems and spatial reasoning challenges that reward observation and patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Fragmented Narrative:</strong> Each document, object, and space unveils traces of a forgotten tragedy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁️ <strong>Unseen Threats:</strong> Something moves in the dark  unheard, unseen, yet always watching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Sound &amp; Tension:</strong> Silence itself becomes a threat; what you hear might never have existed.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌒</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alex’s journey begins here.<br>But every path has a continuation <br>and some paths are simply <strong>too deep to return from.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Community feedback will directly influence future chapters of the story.</i><br><br><i>Note: Currently available in English. Additional language support may be considered after release.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras/11530cd4e8aa29d01fc7fed419b7fd4b.avif?t=1763479003\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras/31a77c8581c0c4809815c841bd36e3f2.avif?t=1763479003\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836090/extras_big/31a77c8581c0c4809815c841bd36e3f2.avif?t=1763479003 width=800 height=267 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕯️ <strong>Message from the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Tales of Ancients</i> is a passion-driven project created by a single developer.<br>Thanks to your feedback, support, and curiosity, this dark story will continue to grow <br>and eventually reach its <strong>final form.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version represents <strong>the first chapter of Alex’s journey.</strong><br>If you wish to see what lies beyond the darkness... we’ll reach there together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕯️ <strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Documentary photographer <strong>Alex Carter</strong> follows the trail of his missing grandfather to the forgotten town of <strong>Lynxvale</strong>.<br>But this place holds more than the remains of the past  it echoes something that was never meant to be remembered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the town stands the <strong>Hollow Apartments</strong>, a silent graveyard of trapped memories.<br>Each apartment carries the shadow of a life once lived.<br>Each floor unveils a part of Alex he never knew existed.<br>And every whisper pulls him deeper into himself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This journey is the first step toward truth...<br>or perhaps where the truth truly begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚙️ <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> A descent into the fragile border between sanity and delusion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔦 <strong>Exploration &amp; Survival:</strong> Every step echoes through the silence. Light can guide you... or betray you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗝️ <strong>Environmental Puzzles:</strong> Mechanical systems and spatial reasoning challenges that reward observation and patience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📜 <strong>Fragmented Narrative:</strong> Each document, object, and space unveils traces of a forgotten tragedy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👁️ <strong>Unseen Threats:</strong> Something moves in the dark  unheard, unseen, yet always watching.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎧 <strong>Sound &amp; Tension:</strong> Silence itself becomes a threat; what you hear might never have existed.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌒</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alex’s journey begins here.<br>But every path has a continuation <br>and some paths are simply <strong>too deep to return from.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Community feedback will directly influence future chapters of the story.</i><br><br><i>Note: Currently available in English. Additional language support may be considered after release.</i></p>",
